  "scope": "Authenticate pre-promotion inventory, independent contracts and fourteen guide inputs at immutable commit6d5f926 while continuing to execute the current promotion and renderers. Capture generic Git history transitions with bounded streamed source spans, complete endpoint hashes and inverse verification; test Unicode, EOF, sparse large sources, child failures and forged transitions. Link independent dependent checked-record composition to VO #1481 without inferring dependent Subtype coverage. Refresh exactly eleven testing-document hashes and preserve every other inventory byte. This prepares actual generic promotion; no supported cell or hosted archive is changed.",
